{# THE PROVENANCE STRIP — one line, at the head of the page.

   A STRIP IS FOR TWO THINGS: it says which record this filing came from, and it
   links back to it. The record's own words, its position and its time are READ in
   the rail ({@see @UhifadhiIncident/report/_observation.html.twig}), and a second
   copy of them above the form would be duplication on the one page a filer is
   trying to get through. Nothing on it is editable — provenance is written once,
   at filing, and never again.

   Parameters: prefill
   ========================================================================== #}
<section class="i-src" data-incident-source-card>
    <div class="hd">{{ ux_icon('incident:git-branch') }}<b>Filed from {{ prefill.label }}</b>
        {% if prefill.backUrl %}<a class="go" href="{{ prefill.backUrl }}">Open the source →</a>{% endif %}</div>

    <p class="i-srcnote">its words, its position and its time are in the rail, at a size that can be
        read · its category guess, coordinates, time and note are already in the form below · the link is kept
        forever</p>
</section>
